---
import TextPage from '../../components/TextPage.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../config/site';
---
<TextPage title={`Terms of Use | ${SITE.name}`} description={`Terms for using ${SITE.name}.`} h1="Terms of use" path="/terms/" updated="November 15, 2026">
  <p>By using {SITE.name} you agree to these terms.</p>
  <h2>Information only</h2>
  <p>The calculators and guides are provided for general information. We work hard to keep them accurate, but we make no guarantee that every result is correct for your situation. Deadlines set by courts, governments, employers, lenders or medical providers may follow special rules (for example, excluding holidays or counting the first day). Always confirm important dates with the organisation responsible.</p>
  <h2>No professional advice</h2>
  <p>Nothing on this site is legal, financial, medical or immigration advice.</p>
  <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>You may use the tools for personal and commercial purposes. Please don’t scrape the site at a rate that affects other visitors, or copy our guides in bulk without permission.</p>
  <h2>Links and ads</h2>
  <p>We are not responsible for the content of external websites or advertisements.</p>
  <h2>Liability</h2>
  <p>To the extent allowed by law, {SITE.name} is not liable for any loss arising from use of the site.</p>
  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update these terms; the date above shows the latest version.</p>
</TextPage>
